        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1850 3-1/2 x 4-3/4 Stainless Flush Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stainless steel flush cup pulls can be used for residential or commercial doors. Durable and sturdy for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding door, swinging doors or pocket doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1850_size.gif?v=1704354498\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1850 Stainless Flush Cup Pull  size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe cup pull is slightly offset for easier grasp. They will fit back to back on a 1-3/8\" thick sliding door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1850-630 Stainless Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 5/8\" on one side only</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 16 Gauge (.060\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  630 Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 4 #8 x 3/4\" Stainless Sheet Metal Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1850.pdf?v=1704262238\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1850 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (with installation hardware).</b>\r\n</p>",
